  "description": {
   "en": "There is no dish as mysterious as the definitive edition of the curry manga that makes life fun . Influenced by many things,\nit is eaten all over the world in different shapes.\nYou and your girlfriend, your father and mother, you and your daughter,\neveryone loves curry.\nMie Misaki, who works for a food manufacturer, meets Masato Kamiya,\nthe son of a long-established Chinese restaurant in Jimbocho who is\ncrazy about curry, and seriously searches for a new and really delicious curry. Please enjoy the curry that the curry men who appear in this manga put their hearts into making!!!"
